atu kalah tablem too nanu iroh ayfaafat nantifiqem meklah afa deqsita.

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:58.670
Anu maqmilwaa kee saqolti xoqoysimah caaloota asgalleh.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:01.730
Inkih yan xoqoysih caalat tannal wagita

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.900
tukteena foyyah tantabbe

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.840
ransa edde ossoonuh doorit yan

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:08.720
Anu ransah goranah innah tanim mabla

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.130
toh celtam kaxxam dago mantafaqqah caaloota too bayteh.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.980
kah kinnim domain mihratleelah mablak, mangom baxxaqisaanam tan.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.950
Ta xoqoysoh caalat, kaxxam qadoh celta,

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.810
Atu baxxaqsa bayissam duuddah

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.460
Hay dadlise numih mabla macaay?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:28.290
toh tayse sahlin xaagih caaloota cabaanam axcih ransa goranto.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.700
tah sanad xiinissoh kaxxa cato matakka?

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:32.870
wadirsi goolisso tekkek

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.920
Sahlin mantafaqqah caalat ransah goranah innal

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.760
Kaqitam meqem yot celta

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:41.570
Anu axcem abbinos caddoh uddur gacsa yaceenim udurrutteh masuginna.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.310
takkay immay numma cugayso tekkek

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:48.450
alaalaqa ekraariseenit, too caalootat duqaysimak meqe qaynonsiyyi ximmo.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:52.300
Ekraarise ransah goranah mantafaqqah caalat wagte.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:55.300
Anu ransa buxaaxih goranah mannal abam duudaah?

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.600
Atu tacsubem duudetto

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.880
Atu muucitte tiyat tasgalle wak, centibbaaru lem celta.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:05.150
numma cugayso tekkek, kaxxam centibbaaru allele.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.240
ta caalatal, agleh caylah faxximtam matan.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:13.910
Anu hudunuh ken esgelleh akkel bayteh tan caaloota tanim baxxaqisuh.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.490
Anu bayteh tan caaloota inkih kibeh

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.880
Anu luukusa lih angaaraw edde bayeh yan caalat liyo.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:25.720
tah maqmilwaa kee saqolti inkih abbinoowele.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.480
Kee abbinos sahhaloosuh, Anu Engeloh afat wiiriseh.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:34.160
Away meqeh kah kinnim tah qunxa cugayso

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:36.160
cogayso nabaah centibbaaru tekkek

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.980
domain mihratli baxxaqsa ankel qimbisam tayseeh?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.380
Gibdim takkeh

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.300
Xiinise maca abaah?

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.700
Tah mango taama

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.620
Saqalak kah qammalsimak sugtennah

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.750
ta caalatal, nanu luukusa kurruumam dudnaa?

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.340
Sekkacsaanam kaadu meqe mabla

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.790
Qimbol anu xiinise axcuk seecan

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.400
dooril kurrumtam takkem bictah

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.820
kee filmi arac yaysibixeenimih maknayat xoqoysimaanama

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:02.870
Irô ayfaafayitte tanim bictah

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.340
nanu luukusa tannal kurruumak,

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.420
Guddaaqah mihrat leela mango maknayle oyta xayyoosaanam duudaanah.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.000
asmatah, tah dubuk inki ceelalloh makeelissoh gurummaca.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:17.320
Gersi meqe gititte tanim bictah

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:21.740
tah tuxxiq le gacsa milallaagu le caalatal rakitak.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.060
Taham amoqayxi

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.170
Ta uddur, nanu caalat muucit xoqoysimenno

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.840
Cugaysoh hadaf daffes

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.700
Anu makeelissoh qemmô caddot gexeh an.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:38.010
Cankah, inkih tan dadal gexsitih uddur

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.060
Anu makeelisso kaxxam gibdim yot celta

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:44.250
kah kinnim nanu xisnam faxximta mango qidiino kee qidiino sinni mabla.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.650
Ciggiila waktil nanu lafale mantafaqqah caaloota wagtenno

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:49.470
mango addatinol tet makeelisnay

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.100
Atu taham fan abteh tan maqarre taamah gadda gey.

